    {
      "id": 200,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        -600,
        0
      ],
      "size": [
        540,
        760
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 0,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "What to download / where to put it",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Repair the left/right seam of a 360 panorama - Krea 2\n\nTurns the panorama by 180 degrees, paints the area behind the camera (middle 34 %) green, lets Krea 2 fill it,\nkeeps the original everywhere else (soft edge), turns it back. For any 2:1 panorama, e.g. MiniMax H3 image or P-H3 image outputs.\nSame idea as pano360_seam_fix_klein. Tested on four H3 / P-H3 images: seam correlation 0.80-0.98 (Klein 0.84-0.97),\nabout 65 s each (Klein 25 s); the regenerated band usually keeps the dim surrounding light better than Klein.\n\n## Models (in `ComfyUI/models/`)\n| File | Folder |\n|---|---|\n| [krea2_turbo_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/blob/main/diffusion_models/krea2_turbo_fp8_scaled.safetensors) | `diffusion_models/` |\n| [qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/blob/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors) | `text_encoders/` |\n| [qwen_image_vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/blob/main/vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors) | `vae/` |\n| [krea2_oedit_360_erp_outpaint_lora_v1.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/mickmumpitz/Krea2-360-ERP-LoRAs/blob/main/krea2_oedit_360_erp_outpaint_lora_v1.safetensors) | `loras/` |\n\n## Custom nodes (in `ComfyUI/custom_nodes/`)\n- **ComfyUI-Pano360** (180 degree roll): https://github.com/shisa84/ComfyUI-Pano360\n- **ComfyUI-Krea2-Ostris-Edit**: https://github.com/ostris/ComfyUI-Krea2-Ostris-Edit\n- **ComfyUI-KJNodes** (soft mask edge): https://github.com/kijai/ComfyUI-KJNodes\n\n## Settings to adapt\n- **Panorama**: load a 2:1 image. The result is scaled back to the original size (from the Get Image Size node).\n- **Style only**: materials, colours, light, no furniture words. **Back**: \"The green area is ...\" = what should be behind the camera.\n- Keep the work size at 1440x720: Krea 2 shrinks bigger references and the band then lands in the wrong place.\n"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
